    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d510">

                <pb facs="0522" n="438" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg438"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72112/5228</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Reinsch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-10-24T14:00:00+08:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 24, 1917, 2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received October 24, 12
                        noon.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Does United States enemy trading legislation apply to transactions with Germans
                    and Austrians resident in China?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
